The bus stops at a busy square.
I get off the bus.
I say goodbye to the older woman.
Now I am going to the metro.
I walk across the square.
There are many people here.
I walk down the wide stairs.
The station is underground.
It is very big and bright.
I have to check in again.
I take out my blue card.
I scan the card on the machine.
The machine makes a loud beep.
Now I can ride with the metro.
I walk down to the platform.
I am taking the next train.
It goes straight towards the harbour.
The train arrives in three minutes.
